    "Only needed if the second account has a login passcode on the PS5. CouchSubs enters it when the PS5 asks. It is kept in the Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only needed if the second account has a login passcode on the PS5. CouchSubs enters it when the PS5 asks. It is kept in the Keychain."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yalnız ikinci hesabın PS5'te giriş şifresi varsa gerekir. PS5 isteyince CouchSubs girer. Anahtar Zinciri'nde saklanır."
          }
