    "For streaming apps without a transparent browser source (TikTok LIVE Studio, Streamlabs and others): open the stream window, add it with Window capture (the window is called CouchSubs Stream) and remove its background with a Chroma key filter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For streaming apps without a transparent browser source (TikTok LIVE Studio, Streamlabs and others): open the stream window, add it with Window capture (the window is called CouchSubs Stream) and remove its background with a Chroma key filter."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saydam tarayıcı kaynağı olmayan yayın programları (TikTok LIVE Studio, Streamlabs ve diğerleri) için: yayın penceresini açın, programda Pencere yakalama ile ekleyin (pencerenin adı CouchSubs Yayın) ve zeminini Chroma key filtresiyle silin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the window open and uncovered while streaming. Subtitles appear in it while the translation is running, even when they are shown only on the TV.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep the window open and uncovered while streaming. Subtitles appear in it while the translation is running, even when they are shown only on the TV."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yayın boyunca pencereyi açık ve önü kapalı olmadan tutun. Çeviri sürerken altyazılar, yalnız TV'de gösterilseler bile bu pencerede görünür."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your streaming app does not accept localhost (TikTok LIVE Studio, for example)? Use this address with the computer's network address:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your streaming app does not accept localhost (TikTok LIVE Studio, for example)? Use this address with the computer's network address:"
